  "description": "Sharpnado.DragDropGridView is a high-performance .NET MAUI control with automatic grid arrangement, adaptive item sizing, and drag-and-drop reordering. Features include ItemsSource/DataTemplate binding, automatic column calculation, configurable spacing and padding, responsive orientation handling, and smooth drag-and-drop with visual feedback. Pure cross-platform implementation with no platform-specific code. Perfect for building draggable tile grids, reorderable galleries, and adaptive collections.",
  "iconFile": "gridlayout.png",
